  "body": "Beautifully renovated, solidly built and superbly positioned in Orewa, 10 Fantail Court is a low-maintenance home where the hard work has already been done.\r\n\r\nThis single-level brick unit has been professionally renovated throughout to an exceptional standard. The new kitchen offers modern cabinetry, generous bench space and excellent storage, while the renovated bathroom includes a walk-in shower. New flooring and fresh paintwork complete a finish that feels modern, polished and ready to enjoy.\r\n\r\nThe light-filled open-plan living and dining area features a raked ceiling, heat pump and wide sliding doors opening directly to a private patio and garden. The double bedroom is bright and well proportioned, with a built-in wardrobe providing practical storage.\r\n\r\nOutside, the private patio and garden create an easy-care space to relax, while a separate storage area and dedicated car park add further convenience.\r\n\r\nPositioned close to Orewa Beach, the estuary, shops, cafés and walking and cycling trails, this home is an excellent option for buyers wanting quality, convenience and easy-care coastal living.\r\n\r\nDisclosure: Some photos have been virtually staged",
